When running Terraform code for provisioning resources in the test environment, ensure you are in the correct directory:

cd terraform/environments/test

Then execute the required Terraform commands.

main.tf
The environment main.tf calls the reusable Terraform module.

Example:

module "gitlab" {
  source = "../../modules/gitlab_ref_arch_aws"

  # variables passed here
}

The environment-specific values are passed from the environment configuration into the reusable module.

