                           |
                           v
                 Reusable Modules Layer
                           |
             +-------------+-------------+
             |             |             |
             v             v             v
       AWS Instance    VPC Peering   GitLab Reference
                                       Architecture
                                             |
                           +-----------------+-----------------+
                           |                 |                 |
                           v                 v                 v
                     GitLab Rails         Gitaly           Praefect
                           |
                           v
                  Supporting AWS Services
                           |
              +------------+------------+
              |            |            |
              v            v            v
             RDS          S3       ElastiCache
                                      (Redis)

The overall design separates environment-specific configuration from reusable infrastructure modules, allowing the same Terraform modules to be reused across different environments while keeping environment-specific values isolated.

The Terraform pipeline provides validation and planning automatically, while terraform apply remains a manual safety gate to prevent unintended infrastructure changes.

